      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOLAN (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 5 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 34.78 beating Adhana Martina. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. CYAN MAGIC (5) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at seven of 16 starts including six wins but missed the frame latest when fourth (31.09) over 531m at this track. Strike rate this distance strong having won two of four tries. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. LARRY WHO (2) was the fastest winner on the program last time out, running away to score by half a length (25.50) at Murray Bridge. Should be in this for a long way. BRINK AND BACK (1) is a last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
